WEBVTT

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:42.630
The Althaia has sent us the final draft
of their plan for the invasion of Tauron.

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:43.800
Open that.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:49.340
"Takeover"?

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:53.390
A "takeover" is when an authority
forcibly occupies another's properties

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:54.930
I know that!

00:00:56.060 --> 00:01:00.560
Taking over a terminal plant for the invasion...

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:04.650
Bee, prepare to send a
personal message to the Council.

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:11.620
<b>Over and over again I wish on the dazzling star far away</b>

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:17.790
<b>Wandering heartbeats, gravitation, the story of their attraction</b>

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:38.020
<b>When did it begin? No one knows the end of it</b>

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:45.110
<b>It's not a trick or an illusion, it's a current that I can't swim against</b>

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:47.150
<b>(Dark!)</b>

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:51.910
<b>The monster that lives in the darkness</b>

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:54.080
<b>(Blight!)</b>

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:57.370
<b>As if I were easily getting swallowed into it.</b>

00:01:57.460 --> 00:01:59.250
<b>(I seek a hero!)</b>

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:01.750
<b>I awake as I truly am</b>

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:10.340
<b>If God says conflicts and life's old dreams go hand in hand</b>

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:15.600
<b>I'm looking for you even if it means ripping my body apart</b>

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:19.430
<b>With a flower held to my heart,</b>

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:24.060
<b>no one can stop this heartbeat now that it's begun</b>

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:28.940
<b>We're destined to come in contact</b>

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:47.710
It's for Mehitak.

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:56.260
What?

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:57.640
It's good.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:00.640
Age grew it.

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:06.270
The Tribe of Pore
doesn't eat anything with life.

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:07.650
Life?

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:10.150
Then what do you eat?

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:29.710
Anything without life.

00:03:57.030 --> 00:03:59.370
You look like you're staring
at your girlfriend or something.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:01.370
It means more than that to me.

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:03.830
Your girlfriend will yell
at you for saying that.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:05.210
I don't have one.

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:08.250
What?

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:10.880
Oh, nothing.

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:18.050
Boy, I can't believe we had to
leave as soon as we arrived at the Earth.

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:20.640
I wish I could've landed on the Earth, too.

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:26.400
We had no choice.
There's no guarantee that planet is really safe.

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:28.770
It must be nice...

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:34.900
I could've gone to that wonderful place
too, if only I had the teleporting ability.

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:39.660
The blue planet... The homeland of humanity...

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.790
One day you'll get a chance.

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:44.910
I wonder when that will be...

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:47.420
When we win this war.

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:50.880
I'll go there with you then.

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:53.460
We can just land on the planet together.

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:57.220
Does that mean you can promise me that?

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:58.800
Uh... Huh...

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:04.850
I'm happy, even though that's a promise
that you'll soon forget once the war begins!

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:06.810
A knight's word is his bond.

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:08.600
In the name of the Mehilim family,

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:13.940
I promise that I'll show you that
planet's magnificent lands and seas.

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:17.280
I'll be looking forward to it, Iolaous!

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:32.840
Whoa, he ate it!

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:34.170
It tastes a little bitter.

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:37.880
Hey, hey, try this next! Eat this one!

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:39.220
Wow...

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:41.430
D-Don't eat my aircraft!

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:46.270
According to the information that
we've obtained from the Pore's Nodos,

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:53.480
two of the three remaining Nodos
have had their tribes taken as hostages.

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:59.450
Does that mean that they might be
on our side if we sheltered their tribes?

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:05.040
Judging from how the Pore's Nodos
has been behaving, it might be possible.

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:08.580
I wish we could find some kind
of way to contact those two Nodos

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:11.500
and suggest that we could
help in releasing their tribes...

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:15.130
But from what we've heard of their agreements,

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:20.010
it isn't stipulated that disobedience
will lead to the extinction of the tribe.

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:21.680
Right...

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:26.720
It rather promises the tribe's
prosperity if they obey the agreement.

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:32.440
Mehitak of the Pore hates to fight,
and he's currently staying with us, but...

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:38.900
Do you think that the other two
might want to be with the Tribe of Silver?

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:40.650
I don't know.

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:47.660
We don't know a thing...
Don't you agree, Captain?

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:50.460
What are you suggesting?

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:55.630
They say that the Tribe of Silver
has helped many tribes in the past

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:58.920
and brought about prosperity to the universe.

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:01.130
So why?

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:06.810
Why do they wish for
destruction only for us humankind?

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:09.930
We don't know what
they're thinking, their objectives,

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:15.610
or even what kind of life they're living.

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:20.900
The more I hear Mehitak talk, the
more I become concerned about that.

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:26.530
It is true that we've just been fighting
them ever since our tribes came in contact,

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:28.790
without any sort of cultural exchange.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:34.210
Without having any idea why
we've been fighting against them...

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:38.380
A group of fleets has been spotted
on our course to the terminal planet!

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:41.970
It's possible that this might
interfere with traffic, Master.

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:49.560
I feel very strong hostility coming
from the Planet Nessus. What's going on?

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:54.020
Looks like those princes
have done something already.

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:07.200
So you mean you absolutely refuse us?

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:12.910
In order to protect this terminal
planet where many starways connect,

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:17.880
we will continue to fight till the very end
against the invasion by the Tribe of Iron.

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:22.670
The neutral stance of terminal planets is
the fundamental principle of space navigation.

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:26.720
And none of the tribes in this
universe will accept the Tribe of Iron,

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:29.510
which tried to take over one.

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:31.890
But we have the Nodos on our side!

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:34.390
Don't tell me you don't know about that.

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:38.480
No matter how brutal you are,
we will not give in to you!

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:42.610
What should we do now, Big Brother?

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:48.110
We can't invade enemy territory without
bringing a terminal planet under our control.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:53.330
If they hinder us, this planet will just
have to be our first military gain in this war.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:55.330
Yes.

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:57.580
All fleets, prepare to attack!

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:23.650
What have they done?

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:28.030
All personnel are now in position.
 It appears that the leading fleets are now
positioned to launch the main cannons!

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:28.780
Energy conduction readings are increasing.
 It appears that the leading fleets are now
positioned to launch the main cannons!

00:09:28.780 --> 00:09:30.200
Energy conduction readings are increasing.
 As a precaution in case of battle,
we're continuing to close the bulkheads.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:33.830
The attack satellite of Planet Nessus
is getting ready for battle.

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:39.000
All leading fleets of the Federation
fleet are now in range of the attack satellite.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:45.170
So they started a war way before they
reached our destination star system...

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:48.590
Deploy the shield. We're going to fall
back to outside of the area of operations.

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:51.260
Men, do not involve
yourselves under any circumstances.

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:52.850
Captain.

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:53.890
Princess?

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:57.850
Please take the ship to
the location where I indicate.

00:09:57.940 --> 00:10:02.860
Receiving data via the psycholine.
I will analyze the location.

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:08.150
As always, what unwavering guidance!

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:35.720
All ships, open fi

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:38.020
You must not!

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:39.810
D-Dhianeila!

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:40.730
Gravitational disturbance detected.

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:43.650
A large ship is warping
out in the area close by!

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:45.110
What did you say?

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:58.040
That's

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:00.870
Citizens of the Planet Nessus...

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:07.590
Oh, you are

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:12.340
The one who arrived at
the planet with no starway...

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:16.430
Please calm your anger.

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:18.680
Those bastards on the Argonaut!

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:21.850
Are they trying to interfere with our holy war?

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:30.780
N-Nodos...

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:35.990
You must not start a war here now.

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:42.000
The ones who start a war will
be the ones met with revenge.

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:50.920
That's the Tribe of Iron's Nodos...

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:57.220
The goal of our war is not
to control you, by any means.

00:11:57.300 --> 00:12:00.770
Please agree on mutual peaceful cooperation.

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:07.900
We refuse no traveler who
pays an appropriate price.

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:13.780
And the price is for the next traveler
to start off a new journey safe and sound.

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:16.320
I'm aware of that.

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:20.330
Message from the Council.
"Cease the takeover of the terminal planet

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:23.660
and comply with their wishes
in terms of resource supply."

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:26.710
The Council, you said? Who contacted them?!

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:32.300
That's the fools of the Argonaut!
Who else could it be?

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:36.130
What high-handedness,
using the Nodos as a shield!

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:42.850
At this rate, the entire fleet will be
driven by Dhianeila's greed, Big Brother!

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:49.770
Oh, my arrogant sister...
Looks like you've made a fatal mistake.

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:50.820
Huh?

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:54.940
I'll bet she was hoping to seize
authority of the fleet here and now,

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:56.820
but she won't get me that way.

00:12:56.910 --> 00:13:00.870
From now on, we're going to let Dhianeila
handle all the troublesome negotiations

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:04.620
with terminal planets so
we can proceed forward.

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:09.460
I see... In other words, if any of them
interfere with our fleet's navigation,

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:11.540
Dhianeila will be responsible.

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:15.840
And we can just focus on
the battle against the enemy.

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:19.590
You see, there's a way
to make use out of a fool.

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:25.060
Way to go, Big Brother. Now why don't
we order the entire fleet to charge forward?

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:26.430
Yeah.

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:42.280
This time they're having the fleet
charge forward, ignoring the supply plan...

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:46.200
Those guys are appallingly predictable.

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:52.500
At this rate, the navigation of the leading
fleet will face problems within 200 hours.

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:57.090
I suppose we have to let Nilval, who's
expected to meet up with them, handle it.

00:13:57.170 --> 00:14:02.970
I'd love it if just those two royals would do
me a favor and drift through space forever.

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.780
Age.

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:26.910
I'm sorry that I asked you to
be in the position that you're in.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:29.290
Everyone's angry, huh?

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:35.710
Because of the fear towards the
enemy that they're about to battle against.

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:42.300
The Tribe of Bronze is the first intruder from
another star system that humankind faced.

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:47.310
And the fear towards them has been
passed down in so many different ways.

00:14:47.930 --> 00:14:49.390
Even though there's Dhianeila?

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:50.560
What?

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:57.230
Age isn't scared. Because there's Dhianeila.

00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:01.910
Is that so?

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:03.200
Yeah!

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:24.180
The Tribe of Iron is trying to start a war.

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:28.010
What's so important about Planet Tauron?

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:32.560
We wish to hear Prome O's opinion.

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:37.690
Their emotions are leading them, Rom Ror.

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:44.200
I don't think there's any
hidden power in the planet at all.

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:46.070
Emotions...

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:53.750
Why is it that you never change your opinion
about the Tribe of Iron and the Tribe of Gold?

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:55.580
I keep on thinking about the possibility

00:15:55.670 --> 00:16:02.010
that the Tribe of Iron will discover
the power of the Tribe of Gold.

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:09.060
Because we should not destroy any
more planets with the Nodos' fights...

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:15.980
Let's send our Nodos before the
Tribe of Iron destroys the planets.

00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:22.070
A massive destruction will
probably occur if we send Yuty.

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:25.410
But the destruction would be
the work of the Tribe of Iron.

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:29.030
We must stop...

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:32.620
our destruction...

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:37.130
So do you mean to tell me that
you're not puzzled by the fact

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:40.090
that the Tribe of Iron is
attacking the Planet Tauron?

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:44.550
Because to them it means revenge.

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:47.680
I can understand where they're coming from.

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:49.800
Revenge...

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:56.640
It is impossible that the power of
the Tribe of Gold exists on Tauron.

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:59.150
That's not what this is about.

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:02.610
They've been robbed of something precious,

00:17:02.690 --> 00:17:06.150
and they want to make its
thieves feel the same pain.

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:10.450
Something precious...

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:14.700
Don't you have that yourself, Yuty?

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:21.130
It is to bring about
prosperity and power to our tribe,

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:25.880
by obeying the
agreements and leading all of you.

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:28.010
What else is there other than that?

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:48.490
I wouldn't necessarily let this body
be ruined only for the agreements.

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:52.200
But you would for something precious?

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:54.740
Right.

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:59.290
Is that something even I can understand?

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:03.420
I just personally think that way. That's all.

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:07.840
It's not something you need to know.

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:10.260
I don't understand.

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:15.520
Besides, you possess Lernaea, who has
the most powerful regeneration ability

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:21.560
among all the five Nodos.
There's no way you'd be easily ruined.

00:18:21.650 --> 00:18:23.400
I sure hope not.

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:26.400
It is obvious. I won't allow it.

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:29.110
I'll keep that in mind.

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:04.060
We've confirmed many ant heaps!

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:06.730
They possess teleporting
ability that's not in our data!

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:08.230
Don't panic!

00:19:08.320 --> 00:19:12.570
Just keep charging forward!
Do not let enemies on this level slow you down!

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:17.660
We received the report on war
conditions from the Calydonian Fleet.

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:20.660
They're expanding the scheduled
combat theater by a large margin

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:23.710
alongside with the Azz-Azoth
Fleet and the follow-on fleets.

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:27.630
They're just letting the
momentum charge them forward as usual...

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:34.800
At least Nilval has been somehow
maintaining the supplies, but still...

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:38.100
It is true that the entire
fleet has gotten a boost.

00:19:38.180 --> 00:19:40.600
Switch to warping position.

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:43.940
We will join the battle
line within twenty hours.

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:31.320
Age?

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:33.740
You're late, Iolaous.

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:36.450
What are you doing up there?

00:20:36.530 --> 00:20:39.740
It's quicker to move out this way.

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:50.170
Don't you forget that I have no
intention to let you fight alone,

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:54.720
no matter how powerful you
are or how powerless I am!

00:20:56.930 --> 00:21:00.720
If Age gets lost you bring him back, Iolaous!

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:06.600
Roger that.

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:40.640
Something precious...

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:47.730
Don't you have that yourself, Yuty?

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:03.910
Yuty La...

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:09.620
We will send you to fight.

00:22:13.170 --> 00:22:17.470
Destroy the fifth Nodos.

00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:33.770
Although I have known you for a long time

00:22:33.860 --> 00:22:41.490
l never dreamed these feelings would sprout

00:22:41.570 --> 00:22:46.910
And I would fall in love with you

00:22:47.000 --> 00:22:57.510
Casually going home,
as I look at the stars in the night sky

00:22:57.590 --> 00:23:10.060
l take the long way on purpose
and lean on your shoulder as we walk

00:23:10.140 --> 00:23:21.450
You tell me you think we can overcome
anything as long as we stay together

00:23:21.530 --> 00:23:26.580
I think as I look into your forthright eyes

00:23:26.660 --> 00:23:33.290
That I love you

00:23:36.710 --> 00:23:41.130
Humankind invades the mother planet
of the Tribe of Bronze, Planet Tauron.

00:23:41.220 --> 00:23:45.590
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 18: "The Victorious Day."
